WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:07.091
VoiceIt is a rapid prototyping tool for products that listen and speak, like smart speakers.

00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:16.318
Such a product is hard to judge on paper. How does it feel to talk to it? Are its answers appropriate, and do they come at the right moment?

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.197
VoiceIt lets you hear and see it, before anything is built.

00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:24.931
Start it from your voiceit folder. It opens in your browser.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:32.105
On the left are your behaviour scripts. Pick one, then pick a form: an image of the product.

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:37.625
Press Play. The scene is performed: voices, screen and light.

00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:46.119
Pause at any moment.

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:48.442
Click the timeline to jump to a moment.

00:00:48.967 --> 00:00:51.489
Then step through it, line by line.

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.399
The script follows along.

00:01:01.867 --> 00:01:07.825
A script is plain text. Change what the product says, or the colour of its light, and save.

00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:13.416
Back in VoiceIt, the change is already there. Play it again.
